'''111 Trocadero''' is a [[W:Skyscraper|skyscraper]] located in the [[Trocadero]] barrio of [[Coruxón]], [[Castejón]], [[Balisca]]. At {{convert|272|m|ft|sp=us}} tall, it is the [[List of tallest buildings and structures in Balisca|eleventh tallest building in Castejón]].{{Castejón}}{{Balisca articles}}
